      <h1>Where Are Hoodies Manufactured? A Global Manufacturing Map for Brands &amp; Buyers</h1>
      <p class="ar-meta">
        <span>By <strong rel="author">YAUUM Sourcing Team</strong></span>
        <span>Published <time datetime="2026-10-12">October 12, 2026</time></span>
      <span class="ar-views" data-views-for="/where-are-hoodies-manufactured/" data-views-hit></span>
      </p>
      <p class="ar-lede">Hoodie production does not spread evenly across the planet. It clusters hard into a handful of regions where yarn spinners, fabric mills, dyehouses, cut-and-sew lines, and trim suppliers sit within a few hours' drive of each other. Understanding why those clusters formed tells you more about sourcing than any list of country names ever will</p>
